WEBVTT

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:32.489
NN: I think the most important thing
was the support from my colleagues,

00:23:32.513 --> 00:23:36.174
being given the flexibility and the time
to develop this and see the results.

00:23:36.198 --> 00:23:37.660
And once you have the results,

00:23:37.684 --> 00:23:39.868
you can just continue to expand.

00:23:39.892 --> 00:23:43.363
AG: SAP is a trailblazer
for autism inclusion in the workplace

00:23:43.387 --> 00:23:45.163
and is inspiring other organizations

00:23:45.187 --> 00:23:48.056
through the SAP Autism Inclusion Pledge.

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:53.033
It's no surprise that SAP earned over
200 Employer of Choice Awards in 2019.

00:23:53.663 --> 00:23:55.363
Check out careers at SAP

00:23:55.387 --> 00:23:57.877
and learn more about experience
management solutions

00:23:57.901 --> 00:23:59.465
for your employees and customers

00:23:59.489 --> 00:24:01.541
at sap.com/worklife.